  {
   "type": "HtmlSection",
   "props": {
    "id": "HtmlSection-176",
    "html": "<section class=\"about-2 section\" id=\"fiber-arts-details\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-10\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title text-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Join Our Fiber Arts Community</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p><a href=\"/calendar?search=fiber%20arts%20club\" class=\"btn btn-main\">Check Calendar for Meetup Times</a></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Kzoo Makers features a fiber arts room with large work tables and dedicated sewing stations. We welcome makers of all skill levels to learn to sew with machines and explore their creativity through all forms of fiber art.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"border\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"row mt-5\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3>Tools and Equipment</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"checklist\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><b>4 Sewing Machines</b> - Multiple stations for simultaneous projects</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><b>1 Serger</b> - Professional finishing for garments</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><b>1 Embroidery/Sewing Machine</b> - Create custom embroidered designs</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><b>Irons and Ironing Boards</b> - Essential pressing equipment</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><b>Yarn Ball Winder and Swift</b> - Prepare your yarn for projects</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><b>Cricut Station with Heat Press</b> - Vinyl cutting and heat transfer</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><b>Rug Tufting Equipment</b> - Create custom rugs and wall hangings</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><b>Cutting Mats, Rulers, and Hand Sewing Tools</b> - All the essentials</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li><b>Paper Crafting and Drawing Supplies</b> - For planning and design</li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-6 mb-4\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3>What Makes Us Special</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<p>Fiber art can be anything from a crocheted coaster to an impressive cosplay creation and is limited only by the imagination.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p><strong>The strength of fiber arts at Kzoo Makers is not simply the machines and tools available, it's the community that makes it special.</strong></p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>Each week our community of fiber artists comes together to create, embellish, and evolve fibers and textiles into art. Knowledge is shared among the group, with expertise in:</p>\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"checklist\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Knitting</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Loom Knitting</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Crochet</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Embroidery</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Cross Stitch</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Felting</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>Sewing</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t<li>And so much more!</li>\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"row mt-4\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-12\">\n\t\t\t\t<h3>Learn and Grow Together</h3>\n\t\t\t\t<p>The fiber arts community has hosted several workshops, including <strong>Sewing Machines 101</strong> where the basics of using a sewing machine are covered, as well as a <strong>food safe yarn dyeing workshop</strong>. Our experienced members are always willing to share their knowledge and help newcomers get started.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t<p>If you've ever been amazed by the wizardry of making fabric using a string and a hook (or two sticks), been enthralled by the beauty of complex colorful cross stitch, or wanted to learn to make your own clothing, the fiber arts community at Kzoo Makers has something for you.</p>\n\n\t\t\t\t<p>Whether you're a complete beginner or an experienced fiber artist, you'll find a welcoming community ready to share techniques, troubleshoot problems, and celebrate your creations. Bring your current project or start something new with guidance from our talented members.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t</div>\n</section>"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "HtmlSection",
   "props": {
    "id": "HtmlSection-177",
    "html": "<section class=\"section\" style=\"background: #f9f9f9;\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-8\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title text-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Why Join Our Fiber Arts Meetup?</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"border\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row mt-4\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4 text-center\">\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"tf-ion-android-people\" style=\"font-size: 60px; color: #28ABE3;\"></i>\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mt-3\">Welcoming Community</h4>\n\t\t\t\t<p>Join a supportive group of fiber artists who share knowledge, techniques, and inspiration. All skill levels are welcome, from absolute beginners to experienced crafters.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4 text-center\">\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"tf-ion-android-star\" style=\"font-size: 60px; color: #28ABE3;\"></i>\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mt-3\">Learn New Skills and More!</h4>\n\t\t\t\t<p>Expand your fiber arts repertoire with guidance from experienced members. Learn knitting, crochet, embroidery, sewing, and more in a hands-on, collaborative environment.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-md-4 mb-4 text-center\">\n\t\t\t\t<i class=\"tf-ion-android-create\" style=\"font-size: 60px; color: #28ABE3;\"></i>\n\t\t\t\t<h4 class=\"mt-3\">Access to Equipment</h4>\n\t\t\t\t<p>Use professional-grade sewing machines, sergers, embroidery equipment, and specialized tools that would be expensive to own individually.</p>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>"
   }
  },
  {
   "type": "HtmlSection",
   "props": {
    "id": "HtmlSection-178",
    "html": "<section class=\"section\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-8\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title text-center\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"border\"></div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t\t<div class=\"row mt-4\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-10 mx-auto\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mb-4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>When does the fiber arts meetup happen?</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Drop in anytime during the meetup to work on your projects and connect with fellow fiber artists.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/calendar?search=fiber%20arts%20club\" class=\"btn btn-main\">Check Calendar for Times</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mb-4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Do I need to be a member to attend?</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>No you can bring your own tools and equipment, but if you want to use any tools owned by Kzoo Makers, you will need the \"Clean Side Tools\" membership.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/tour-form-redirect\" class=\"btn btn-main\">Schedule a Tour</a>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"btn btn-main ml-2\">View Membership Options</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mb-4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>I'm a complete beginner. Can I still join?</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Absolutely! We welcome makers of all skill levels. Our community members are happy to help beginners get started with basic techniques and equipment operation.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mb-4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Do I need to bring my own supplies?</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Please bring your own materials (fabric, yarn, thread, etc.) for your projects. We have equipment and tools, but members supply their own consumable materials.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mb-4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>What types of fiber arts are practiced at the meetup?</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Our community includes experts in knitting, loom knitting, crochet, embroidery, cross stitch, felting, sewing, rug tufting, and more. If it involves fiber or textiles, someone in our group probably does it!</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mb-4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>Can I get training on the sewing machines?</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Yes! We offer Sewing Machines 101 workshops and experienced members are available to help you learn the equipment. Training ensures you can use the machines safely and effectively.</p>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"mb-4\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h4>What if I can't make it every time?</h4>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>No problem! Come when you can. You're welcome to use the fiber arts room anytime during open hours as a member.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<a href=\"/calendar?search=fiber%20arts%20club\" class=\"btn btn-main\">Check Calendar for Times</a>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>"
   }
  },
