    "id": "HtmlSection-179",
    "html": "<section class=\"section\" style=\"background: #f9f9f9;\">\n\t<div class=\"container\">\n\t\t<div class=\"row justify-content-center align-items-center mb-5\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-5 mb-4 mb-md-0 text-center\">\n\t\t\t\t<img src=\"/images/clipart/fiberart.webp\" alt=\"Woodworking Tools\" class=\"img-fluid\" style=\"max-width: 300px;\">\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-7\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"title\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<h2>Want to support the makerspace?</h2>\n\t\t\t\t\t<p>Meeting and bringing your own stuff is free, to use all our fiber arts tools and equipment like sewing machines, you'll need the \"Clean Side Tools\" membership. Schedule a tour to learn more about membership options.</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"border\"></div>\n                    <div class=\"col-lg-10 text-center\">\n                        <a href=\"/tour-form-redirect\" class=\"btn btn-main mt-20\">Schedule a Tour</a>\n                        <a href=\"/pricing\" class=\"btn btn-main mt-20 ml-2\">View Membership Options</a>\n                        <a href=\"/calendar?search=fiber%20arts%20club\" class=\"btn btn-main mt-20 ml-2\">Check Calendar for Meetup Times</a>\n                    </div>\n\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</section>"
